    "name": "bordrless_token",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "spec": "0.1.0",
    "description": "The Bordrless Token Standard (BTS): mints, holdings, transfers, delegation, freezing, on-chain metadata, and the hook protocol that lets a program run before and after every transfer, mint and burn, take up to three cuts from a transfer and keep 64 bytes of state in every holding."
  },
